.resources/TASK-260715-3ejhyy/active-macos-production-composition-scope.md:1:macOS is the only production provider target in this task; iOS is deferred. Consume the accepted TASK-260720-1qhxqa binding manifest without reinterpretation and selected libssh2 only. Wire the already accepted profile snapshot loader, mandatory approved-host policy, system-domain Keychain resolver, and SSH bootstrap diagnostic mapper into the production graph. The harness must use the same candidate-neutral interfaces with deterministic substitutes, while production must fail closed before route application on missing, stale, superseded, digest-mismatched, pin-mismatched, or capability-incomplete bindings. Keep prepare pure and separately prove that activateReads begins PacketFlow/HEV ownership only after settings. No App Groups, Keychain Sharing, ambient Keychain lookup, host-key bypass, raw secret/identity logging, reconnect, general UDP, or new final tuning values. Use Swift Testing and existing boundary scripts; verify behavior, ownership, and repeated teardown, not just compilation.
